# SuperMox base network configuration.
#
# DHCP is NOT configured with an "inet dhcp" stanza: ifupdown2's dhcp method
# hard-codes /sbin/dhclient, which Devuan does not ship (it ships dhcpcd-base).
# /etc/init.d/networking therefore runs dhcpcd itself for interfaces that need
# an address. This file holds the stanzas ifupdown2 *can* handle; add static
# or manual stanzas below.
auto lo
iface lo inet loopback
